get elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"c895962\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\">\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center style-modern\">\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/manufacturing-1-qk63h2x2amk58vb76tw2299f4yx6vmjjhhi5i991qu.png\" title=\"manufacturing\" alt=\"manufacturing\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h5 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        1. Warehouse Management\n                        \n                    <\/h5>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        \u2022 We utilize barcode and RFID based technology for accurate tracking, maintain a comprehensive item database, and optimize warehouse space.\n\u2022 Our systematic approach enhances efficiency, and enforces access controls for security. Adherence to safety regulations ensures staff well-being and accident prevention.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-896f2d4\" data-id=\"896f2d4\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db1fd33 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"db1fd33\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\">\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center style-modern\">\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"350\" src=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/manufacturing-2-1.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-14228\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/manufacturing-2-1.png 500w, https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/manufacturing-2-1-300x210.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h5 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        2. Work-in-Process Tracking\n                        \n                    <\/h5>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Our Work In-Progress (WIP) software offers real-time tracking and monitoring of manufacturing processes, providing manufacturers with invaluable insights into workflow status, resource utilization, and production errors.\nBy digitizing WIP management, the manufacturers can have seamless coordination between different departments, optimizing resource allocation and minimizing idle time.\n                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-da2d0b1\" data-id=\"da2d0b1\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6f3cfa ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"d6f3cfa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\">\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center style-modern\">\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/manufacturing-3-qk63gqp5ts3f1xsy66lwnucfeylf3k713t0u9nr5zq.png\" title=\"manufacturing (3)\" alt=\"manufacturing (3)\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h5 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        3. Machine Vision and Automation \n                        \n                    <\/h5>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Implementing machine vision technology, we provide automated inspection systems for defect identification and quality control.\nOur solutions enable manufacturers to detect even the minutest defects, ensuring compliance to quality standards and eliminating the risk of defective products reaching the market.\n                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-9aea492 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"9aea492\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-cc6c9f0\" data-id=\"cc6c9f0\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a4544de ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"a4544de\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\">\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center style-modern\">\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/manufacturing-4-qk63gugil48nev94pn1a7vrrukuin8emucgghpku5o.png\" title=\"manufacturing (4)\" alt=\"manufacturing (4)\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h5 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        4. Industry 4.0 and IIOT\n                        \n                    <\/h5>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        By implementing Industry 4.0 and IIOT, we offer connected solutions for analytical measures, asset optimization, and data-driven decision-making.\nOur solutions give manufacturers the advantage of data analytics, algorithms, and machine learning to drive constant improvement and innovation.\n                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-534e947\" data-id=\"534e947\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e3b6702 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"e3b6702\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\">\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center style-modern\">\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/manufacturing-5-qk63gxa15mcidp519695xd25mqgmabptuqewxjgnn0.png\" title=\"manufacturing (5)\" alt=\"manufacturing (5)\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h5 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        5. Track and Trace\n                        \n                    <\/h5>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Through our track-and-trace software, manufacturers gain end-to-end visibility into the movement of raw materials, they can track work-in-progress, and finished goods across the supply chain.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-246b1da\" data-id=\"246b1da\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-634a0e0 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"634a0e0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\">\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center style-modern\">\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/manufacturing-6-qk63h03jq4gdcj0xsph1mucjew2pxf10v4ddddch4c.png\" title=\"manufacturing (6)\" alt=\"manufacturing (6)\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h5 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        6. Turnaround Time Tracking\n                        \n                    <\/h5>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        With real-time turnaround time monitoring, our solutions give manufacturers the advantage to identify and address inadequacies in manufacturing processes.\nBy optimizing turnaround times, manufacturers can improve operational efficiency, reduce lead times, and meet customer demands more efficiently.\n                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c34468f elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c34468f\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-eb4c0ed\" data-id=\"eb4c0ed\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-04ee5a1 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"04ee5a1\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-bfe2e87\" data-id=\"bfe2e87\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap eleme